suresh: Go pattern: add retry loop with increasing backoff and explicit EOF handling. keep it straightforward so readers can adapt it to their RPC stub.

liza: Go proposal:
```go
ctx := context.Background()
var cursor string = ""
for attempt := 0; attempt < 3; attempt++ {
    stream, err := client.GenerateStream(ctx, &GenerateOptions{Prompt: prompt, Cursor: cursor})
    if err != nil {
        time.Sleep(time.Duration(150*(1<<attempt)) * time.Millisecond)
        continue
    }
    for {
        tok, err := stream.Recv()
        if err == io.EOF { break }
        if err != nil { /* treat as transient and retry */ break }
        fmt.Print(tok)
    }
    break
}
```

